{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的音乐感受提示不如Y细腻具体，也缺少按音乐小节出现的时间对应，部分细微的情绪转折容易被压缩。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的叙述与感受分区明确，普通观众可以先抓住人物经历，再扫右侧提示，不容易在大量感受词中迷失主线。它对人物为什么反复动摇、为什么逐渐改变交代得更充分，开头的离开、中间的怀念与挣扎、最后的自我接纳也串得更连贯。Y的关键词突出和按小节出现的感受更有优势，情绪及音乐细节也明显更丰富，但部分段落感受信息过密，反而削弱了故事主线的连续性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c9d0431d-cfb9-400b-b4ff-d8c06df2298f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T073036890534Z", "elapsed_seconds": 88.703, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:32:05.587833+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "11242bc953bf7fa60f81be4b56f04f58693d971f03b9c4de900e9e8e74d80253", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py